# politician_portfolios

Source: https://api.unusualwhales.com/docs/openapi.yaml; retrieved 2026-09-24T01:21:27.462441+00:00

Full descriptions, inherited security, effective parameters, responses and schemas. No live calls.

## GET /api/politician-portfolios/disclosures

Annual Disclosures List

Returns all annual disclosure file records for politicians.
Can be filtered by politician_id and/or limited to latest per politician.

This is an enterprise only endpoint. Contact dev@unusualwhales.com for details about accessing this data.


### Fully resolved operation
```json
