## GET /api/politician-portfolios/holders/{ticker}

Politician Portfolio Holders by Ticker

Returns all politician portfolio owner names, ID, and holdings for the specified ticker.

This is an enterprise only endpoint. Contact dev@unusualwhales.com for details about accessing this data.


### Fully resolved operation
```json
{
  "key": "GET /api/politician-portfolios/holders/{ticker}",
  "method": "GET",
  "path": "/api/politician-portfolios/holders/{ticker}",
  "transport": "http-rest",
  "operation": {
    "callbacks": {},
    "description": "Returns all politician portfolio owner names, ID, and holdings for the specified ticker.\n\nThis is an enterprise only endpoint. Contact dev@unusualwhales.com for details about accessing this data.\n",
